Court of Human RightspartialThe texts of the amending Protocols are on the Treaty Office site, which answers our server with a Cloudflare block. NextSpainItalyIrelandBelgiumPolandCzechiaEstoniaFinlandFrom our institution register, 17 November 2026. See it live.Free to start, priced by what you use.For trying it and for small agents.1,000 requests a dayREST API and MCP serverEverything we hold, every jurisdictionGet a free keyUsage€1per 1,000 requestsFor products with users of their own.Limits set to your trafficUse in client-facing productsInvoiced monthly, no minimumRequest this planThe corpus itself, in your own systems.Every text, version and citation link as filesEach day's changes, every dayStore it, index it, build on itAsk for a sampleFounding customers10 places€300a month, fixed for two yearsFor the first ten companies that build on Pandex. Cancel any month.The API without counting requests, up to 1 million a monthUse in client-facing productsYou name the next country or source we loadYour questions answered in writing by the people who built itThe Feed at half price, from €500 a monthIn return: your name on this page and two lines on what you built.Take a founding placeStart building with PandexA key is free and takes a minute. For more than that, tell us what you’re building.",
