      "id": "bbc-2026-11-21-we-re-not-meant-to-carry-life-s-challenges-alone-catherine-s",
      "title": "'We're not meant to carry life's challenges alone', Catherine says in first clip",
      "summary": "Catherine has spoken about how \"cancer does change you\" in a documentary that will be screened on BBC One on 29 November.",
      "body": "The Princess of Wales' cancer journey is set to be depicted in a new BBC documentary \"Heal\" that will air next weekend.It follows Catherine announcing in January 2025 that she was in remission after having revealed her diagnosis less than a year prior.She has since spoken openly about her illness and treatment although has never disclosed publicly what type of cancer she faced.The new documentary will include footage of her completing the Three Peaks Challenge earlier this year.\"It changes your body, it changes you physically - but there is a much, much deeper part to what a cancer diagnosis shifts in you,\" she says.More on this story.",
