      "body": "Add the responseURL field to jqXHR (#4339, 5691e03a)\nSupport an alternative completeCallback API for transports (a05c3d73)\nRefactor loops to avoid going behind array bounds (5f8ed054)\nDrop getElementsBy{Tag,Class}Name in favor of querySelectorAll (#3642, 53a2bcf9)\nEmpty the computeTableStyleTests probe table when it might be reused (#5932, f37226f0)\nUse createElementNS to support XML documents (#4730, dcb31ae8)\nShave off some bytes (eb9acfe9)\nAdd a new commercial support vendor: TuxCare (b75c1fef)\nFix spelling of XMLHttpRequest in README (#5903) (71c0dd14)\nAdd guidelines for machine-generated contributions (51eb576c)\nUpdate the jQuery NES HeroDevs link in README (#5853) (dd7b28f4)\nUpdate active version table (fef45254)\nupdate README with 4.0 release (#5781, 5bffcc1a)\nWork around a Safari 27 regex interepreter bug (b557a8c4)\nFix the runescape regex in unescapeSelector (e77f87c8)\nDecode invalid escape code points to U+FFFD (#5845) (7e1efd77)\nOptimize jQuery.uniqueSort duplicate removal (35789e76)\nBe more strict in quick selection paths (a104324d)\nFix ReDoS in identifier matching (d41cf7dd)\nUse loose document comparisons everywhere (74439453)\nSupport form-associated custom elements (#5245, 680c320c)\nExpect reliableTrDimensions to fail in Chrome (feaa9fcd)\nMake the \"jQuery.parseXML - error reporting\" test less strict (5ed303d0)\nAccept old & new :enabled/:disabled option/optgroup semantics (99f32901)\nAdd tests for jQuery.text (3818952f)\nAdd unit tests for callback-only animation signatures (#1738, ac837496)\nRe-enable the AJAX binary data tests in IE (882be391)\nAdd jQuery.ajaxPrefilter & jQuery.ajaxTransport tests (0872b898)\nAdd tests for .data() on SVG elements (d1ff507a)\nIncrease test coverage of the serialize module (d97d76f1)",
