      "body": "Up Next. Catherine visits Mumbai maternity hospital on the last day of royal trip. Video, 00:00:58SubsectionWorldPublished16 hours agoInside the old gas pipeline where Ukraine is fighting an underground war with Russia. Video, 00:03:55SubsectionEuropePublished21 hours agoWatch: Predatory Met detective's behaviour became increasingly extreme. Video, 00:02:49SubsectionUKPublished2 days agoWhen will we see Robert Pattinson as Bond in cinemas? Video, 00:00:36SubsectionCulturePublished2 days ago'Good Bond vibes' - Hollywood locals react to Robert Pattinson cast as new 007  Video, 00:01:09SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoPope Leo hit by flying rosary while waving to crowds in Peru. Video, 00:00:32SubsectionWorldPublished2 days agoStreet cricket with a legend then metro ride as William and Kate begin India visit. Video, 00:00:56SubsectionIndiaPublished2 days ago'It felt like I was dying': Why some teenagers don't go to school. Video, 00:02:22SubsectionUKPublished3 days agoPope Leo rides in helicopter cockpit during Peru trip. Video, 00:01:09SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished3 days ago'Can you believe it?': SpaceX catches part of its Starship rocket on return to Earth. Video, 00:01:10SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished4 days agoPhilippines takes the crown in first Eurovision Song Contest Asia. Video, 00:01:21SubsectionAsiaPublished4 days ago",
