      "body": "版权与许可声明APP: GPLv3 with the FM1 SDK linking exception; no warranty. SDK and firmware resources have separate redistribution terms in THIRD_PARTY.md. Source: https://open.m-vave.com/releases/V14/6324230590b8e332bc544128abd7b919a2efd5982db60ea9a11663d4ea820344/FM1-Open-V14-Development-Kit-copy-update.zip\nFM-1 V15 recovery firmware: https://www.m-vave.com/download (PC Firmware / FM-1 V15). Distributed by M-VAVE under Apache-2.0. Retain applicable licenses and notices; components with separate licenses retain their terms. See THIRD_PARTY.md.\nProject-owned public APP sources: [GPLv3 with the FM1 SDK linking exception](LICENSE.md). Component licenses also apply to firmware and web builds that include those components.\n| Component | Source / license |\n| --- | --- |\n| 303 | [Open303](https://github.com/RobinSchmidt/Open303/tree/313bf0d9ade7c1dcb6b3a74f5ea1780a29d70074), MIT; C adaptation with FM1 drive and MIDI handling. |\n| 808 / Pluck | [DaisySP](https://github.com/daisyaudio/DaisySP/tree/2c72eaf9eac5fc0dca1919d65d606da907832618), MIT; selected Plaits drum and String models with FM1 voices and controls. |\n| SVF | [stmlib](https://github.com/pichenettes/stmlib/tree/d18def816c51d1da0c108236928b2bbd25c17481), MIT; fixed-rate filter adaptation. |\n| FM model | [MSFA](https://github.com/google/music-synthesizer-for-android/tree/f67d41d313b7dc85f6fb99e79e515cc9d208cfff) / [Dexed msfa](https://github.com/asb2m10/dexed/tree/eebb748b70c5a1338afa3945e8b1ea783c9c02fe/source/msfa), Apache-2.0; C adaptation of algorithms, envelopes, LFO and note scaling, with FM1 arithmetic and controls. |\n| PSG | [emu2149](https://github.com/digital-sound-antiques/emu2149/tree/441f3dc295a9b82db16921461f0678b483db8304), MIT; memory/table adaptation and ultrasonic output fix. |\n| SEA codec | [SEA](https://github.com/Daninet/sea-codec), MIT; fixed-format encoder, decoder and tables. |\n| Packager | [jl-misctools](https://github.com/kagaimiq/jl-misctools/tree/0a5b12db0ef38f3042acffbe2452730a37fd2405), MIT; format/codec adaptation with FM1 validation and layout. |\n| Native C runtime | `sdk/lib/libc.a`, Newlib-derived routines; native runtime notices below. |\n| Native compiler runtime | `sdk/lib/libcompiler_rt.a`; identified compiler-rt routines, legacy MIT / University of Illinois-NCSA notices below.  |\n| micro-ecc | Identified routines in `sdk/lib/libfm1_engine.a`; BSD-2-Clause notice below. |\n| JieLi SDK material | Identified AC79 SDK material retains its upstream terms; see SDK notices below. |\n| APP / open web engine tuning | Incorporates contributions by [Vikram Rojo (PR #2)](https://github.com/m-vave/fm1_open/pull/2), with FM1 integration changes (2026-10-17). Original file licenses and notices are retained. |\n| Configuration resource | `sdk/tools/pack/cfg_tool.bin`, identical to the file in the identified official JieLi Apache-2.0 SDK distribution; see below. |\n| Boot/update resources and recovery firmware | `sdk/tools/pack/uboot.boot`, `ota.bin`, `boot-config.bin`, and `sdk/firmware/FM-1_015.fwsc`, Apache-2.0; see the resource terms below. |\n| Original 128-voice DX7 bank | `app/fm_factory.inc`: extracted without parameter or ordering changes from the bundled M-VAVE V15 recovery image (Apache-2.0), losslessly encoded for Flash in 2026. Reproduce with `node tools/Generate-Factory-DX7.mjs`; the tool pins the source package and decoded VMEM SHA-256 hashes. Demo project recipes remain separate. |\nCompany-authored FM1 modifications, FX, arrangements and synthesized demo samples: Copyright (c) 2026 珠海笙科智能科技有限公司 (M-VAVE). Product names identify compatible formats; no upstream endorsement is implied.\nFor the proprietary engine components in `sdk/lib/libfm1_engine.a` that 珠海笙科智能科技有限公司 (M-VAVE) owns or has authority to license, M-VAVE grants each recipient a non-exclusive, royalty-free permission to:\n1. Download, retain and copy those components for developing and using firmware on M-VAVE FM1 devices.\n2. Link those components with the APP or a modified APP, and build, install and run the resulting firmware on M-VAVE FM1 devices.\n3. Redistribute those components in binary form, separately as SDK components or as part of firmware and firmware-inclusive workbenches for M-VAVE FM1 devices, for commercial or non-commercial purposes.\nRedistributions must retain applicable copyright and license notices and include this file. No proprietary SDK source is supplied. The FM1-only condition applies to the proprietary engine grant; the APP, third-party components and separately licensed resources retain their respective rights and terms. Complete packages must comply with each component's license, including applicable corresponding-source requirements.\n### Boot/update resources and recovery firmware\nThe boot/update files in `sdk/tools/pack/` (`uboot.boot`, `ota.bin`, `cfg_tool.bin`, `boot-config.bin`) and the recovery image `sdk/firmware/FM-1_015.fwsc` are distributed by M-VAVE under the Apache License, Version 2.0. That license permits use, modification and redistribution, including binary redistribution for commercial or non-commercial purposes, subject to its terms. Include the Apache-2.0 license, mark modified files as required, and retain applicable copyright, attribution and NOTICE material under section 4. The full license is reproduced under “FM model / Apache-2.0” below. Components with their own license notices retain those terms. These resource permissions do not change the APP's GPLv3 license or the proprietary engine's separate terms.\nThe APP license does not apply to proprietary SDK components. M-VAVE supplies its proprietary components as-is, without warranty. To the extent permitted by applicable law, M-VAVE is not liable for losses arising from their use, including data loss or device malfunction. Mandatory statutory rights and separately agreed warranties are unaffected.\n1. 为开发和使用 M-VAVE FM1 设备固件而下载、保存和复制这些组件。\n2. 将这些组件与 APP 或修改后的 APP 链接，编译、安装并在 M-VAVE FM1 设备上运行所得固件。\n3. 以二进制形式再分发这些组件，包括作为单独的 SDK 组件、FM1 固件或内含该固件的工作台的一部分，允许商业及非商业用途。\n**引导及恢复资源：**上述 `uboot.boot`、`ota.bin`、`cfg_tool.bin`、`boot-config.bin` 及 `FM-1_015.fwsc` 由 M-VAVE 按 Apache License 2.0 分发，可依其条款使用、修改及再分发，包括商业和非商业用途的二进制再分发。分发时须附 Apache-2.0 许可，按要求标明文件修改，并依第 4 条保留适用的版权、署名和 NOTICE 内容；许可全文见下方“FM model / Apache-2.0”。具有单独许可声明的组件保留各自条款。本组资源的许可不改变 APP 的 GPLv3 许可及专有引擎的单独条款。\nAPP 许可不适用于专有 SDK 组件；专有组件按现状提供，不提供担保。在适用法律允许范围内，M-VAVE 不对使用这些组件导致的损失承担责任，包括数据丢失或设备异常；不可排除的法定权利及另行约定的担保不受影响。\nReference: [JieLi AC79 AIoT SDK](https://gitee.com/Jieli-Tech/fw-AC79_AIoT_SDK/tree/5fa84a9b2f723a5e9337ad79dc2ad741fc98fe2d), commit `5fa84a9b2f723a5e9337ad79dc2ad741fc98fe2d`.\nUpstream distribution notice: Copyright © 2024-2026 Zhuhai Jieli Technology Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.\nApache-2.0-covered SDK material retains that license. The full text appears below. Newlib, compiler-rt and other components retain their respective licenses and notices; the SDK's root license does not replace them. Redistribution must retain applicable license and NOTICE material and identify modifications as required.\nCopyright (C) 2017 Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.  All Rights Reserved.\nPermission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of\nthis software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal in\nthe Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights to\nuse, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of\nthe Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so,\nsubject to the following conditions:\nThe above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\ncopies or substantial portions of the Software. If you wish to use our Amazon\nFreeRTOS name, please do so in a fair use way that does not cause confusion.\nTHE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\nIMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS\nFOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR\nCOPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER\nIN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN\nCONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.\nIdentified micro-ecc routines retain the BSD-2-Clause notice from [micro-ecc](https://github.com/kmackay/micro-ecc/blob/541b3a78026420a3e369c4c9281c396b5e531113/LICENSE.txt). This identifies the notice source, not the vendor archive's exact revision.\nCopyright (c) 2014, Kenneth MacKay\nRedistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification,\nare permitted provided that the following conditions are met:\n* Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice, this\nlist of conditions and the following disclaimer.\n* Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright notice,\nthis list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the documentation\nand/or other materials provided with the distribution.\nTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS \"AS IS\" AND\nANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED\nWARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE\nDISCLAIMED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER OR CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR\nANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES\n(INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES;\nLOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON\nANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT\n(INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS\nSOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.\nCopyright (c) 2009 Robin Schmidt (Open303).\nCopyright (c) 2020 Electrosmith, Corp. (DaisySP).\nCopyright (c) 2016 Emilie Gillet (Plaits).\nCopyright (c) 2014 Emilie Gi