      "author": "Justine Calma",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T17:44:22.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/11/gettyimages-2301295182.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,12.121468677824,100,75.757062644352",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/1033051/nvidia-jensen-huang-chips-gpu-supply-chain-climate-pollution",
