    {
      "id": "bbc-2026-11-13-my-window-faces-a-brick-wall-what-s-your-rent-in-nyc",
      "title": "'My window faces a brick wall': What's your rent in NYC?",
      "summary": "We ask people in New York City how much they pay for their homes.",
      "body": "Up Next. Pope Leo rides in helicopter cockpit during Peru trip. Video, 00:01:09SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished9 hours ago'Can you believe it?': SpaceX catches part of its Starship rocket on return to Earth. Video, 00:01:10SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoPhilippines takes the crown in first Eurovision Song Contest Asia. Video, 00:01:21SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoHow Mississippi's new senator won in Trump's heartland - and what he will do next. Video, 00:03:44SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoWatch: Children in Need 2026... in 90 seconds. Video, 00:01:30SubsectionUKPublished2 days agoJensen Huang has resigned, what's next for Nvidia? Video, 00:01:14SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 days ago'We've got to run': Inside ruined Ukraine power plant under constant drone threat. Video, 00:01:23SubsectionWorldPublished3 days ago'I felt like I was being manipulated': Woman alleges Walliams groomed her as a teenager. Video, 00:02:11SubsectionCulturePublished4 days agoWhat we know about the allegations against David Walliams. Video, 00:01:49SubsectionCulturePublished5 days ago'If I tell you to run, run': BBC joins a Ukrainian drone unit as it protects a front-line city. Video, 00:01:36SubsectionEuropePublished5 days ago'No emotion': What happened in court as Russell Brand was sentenced. Video, 00:01:05SubsectionCulturePublished6 days ago",
